# Tooling, not the game.
#
# This repo is what Cloudflare deploys — everything committed
# here is served at mrtd.aydinyeung.workers.dev. These are
# editor and agent config, so they stay local: no reason to
# publish them, and one fewer file in every build.
.claude/
.mcp.json

# Migrations are written, run once against Supabase, then
# deleted. Anything still sitting here is waiting to be run and
# has no business in a deploy.
*.sql

# Windows and editors.
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
